                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "欸——还有点遗憾呢。\n纳蕾娜，我真的不能撞你吗？\n<style=SizeSmall>刺激，莫白瞪了我一眼……</style>",
