                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204004501_59586729_content",
                "value": "欸——还有点遗憾呢。\n纳蕾娜，我真的不能撞你吗？\n<style=SizeSmall>刺激，莫白瞪了我一眼……</style>",
