              "content": "这次有惊无险，可喜可贺。\n我们一起回星球，\n我煮壶茶，给大家压压惊，嚯嚯！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204004501_59586730_content",
                "value": "这次有惊无险，可喜可贺。\n我们一起回星球，\n我煮壶茶，给大家压压惊，嚯嚯！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
